WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-RU

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:07.859
Hello and welcome back to lamrim.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.080
We are starting the ninth lesson.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.320
I like to call it
"Journey to the Center of the Sun."

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:20.900
We've already talked about how
there is something big and powerful enough -

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:29.380
like a nuclear bomb - that can be used to clean
ketchup off your shirt.

00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:35.879
And I'm not exaggerating.
I want you to think so.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.410
Imagine,

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:43.240
today is Independence Day in America.
I am performing on Independence Day.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:53.600
We often go on a picnic with our family.
It's the middle of summer,

00:00:54.520 --> 00:01:02.880
and American kids will be eating hot dogs
or hamburgers, and they'll use too much ketchup,
and some of the ketchup will end up in here.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:13.200
Imagine that in order to clean this, Mom sends a shirt or blouse into the heart of the sun,

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.420
[inaudible]

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:20.840
to clean a little stain of ketchup, red ketchup.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.380
I know it sounds strange,

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:31.020
but I'd like you to try to think about it.
I would like you to try to think about this.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.060
I don't know what they are compared to.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.980
Yes, I don't know.
Just put some tiny thing in the middle of the sun, okay?

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:46.120
So today we are going to visit the center of the sun.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:55.280
And I am happy to report that we have just reached the third and final section of lamrim.

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.360
Steps on the path to enlightenment.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.700
Right now we are going to move on
to the actions of a bodhisattva.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:12.040
We are about to move on to the
thinking and activity of a bodhisattva,

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:16.260
who is a person of the highest faculties.
KYES BU CHEN PO (kyes bu chien po)

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:19.700
What does it mean a person of great abilities.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:26.280
Those of you, especially those who have been following this lamrim for the last ten years,

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:33.860
you should be very happy that you survived
and that I survived to get to the last part.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:37.580
We have come to the last part.
This is the last third.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:43.360
So, these mathematicians among you must be thinking: okay, Geshe-la,

00:02:44.079 --> 00:02:46.529
you just said that we have 25% left.

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.240
So why is it the last third?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:03:02.500
And the answer is that
Pabongkha Rinpoche's address in the last two days of
lamrim is too short.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:09.540
His presentation of meditation
and his presentation of the vision of emptiness, the

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:14.480
last two perfections of the six, are
not too long.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.680
And I don't know what happened.
I mean, sometimes it's

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.820
like the sponsor came to him and said we're going to run out of food in two days.  Wrap it up

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:24.860
!

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:31.140
It's possible -
maybe this is a mystical message from Tara.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:35.960
Maybe, I don’t know,
maybe he had another appointment in another city.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:50.480
But if you ask me, Pabongka Rinpoche
made the last two parts shorter because
Je Tsongkhapa revealed them in his great lamrim.  The

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:54.600
Great Book
of Steps to Enlightenment,
Lam Rim Chenmo

00:03:55.160 --> 00:04:01.040
Tsongkapa has done such a great job that I think
I just see Pabongka Rinpoche saying,

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:05.540
you know, guys,
I don't have much reason to teach this part

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:12.560
because Tsongkapa has already taught it
and he has done it in an extraordinary way.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:17.940
There are many, many stories about how
Tsongkhapa wrote these last two parts,

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.780
and I am very happy
that we will study them together.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:29.260
So we are going to finish this lamrim series
with some amazing teachings on meditation and emptiness.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:38.680
Why is this part about the steps of the path for people who have bodhicitta,

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.440
for Bodhisattvas,

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:44.020
not as long as it could be.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.640
So, let's go.
Let's read Tibetan.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.780
sum pa kye pu chen pyo lam kyi rim (GSUM PA SKYES BU CHEN PO'I LAM GYI RIM)
par lo chang wa la (PAR BLO SBYANG BA LA)

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:57.820
Let us train our hearts in the steps of the path
for people of great ability.

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:00.520
People who are bodhisattvas.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.700
thek chhen kyi juk go sem kye kho nar ten pa phen yon tang che pa (THEG CHEN GYI 'JUG SGO SEMS BSKYED KHO NAR BSTAN PA PHAN YON DANG BCAS PA)

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:09.500
He says that we are going to reveal the
bodhisattva way of life,

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.560
we are going to cover it in three different stages.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.440
Number one.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:19.860
thek chhen kyi juk go (THEG CHEN GYI 'JUG SGO)
If you want to enter the path of the Bodhisattva,
there is only one way to get there.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.620
By achieving a certain state of mind.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:29.660
If you want to achieve enlightenment,
if you want to have a chance to become enlightened,

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:36.260
if you want to have a chance to help the world,
there is only one way.
You must obtain bodhicitta.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:44.460
You must have this desire to achieve enlightenment
so that you can help countless beings.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:47.700
Now I want to talk about the infinite.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.500
Bodhicitta is directed towards countless sentient beings.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:06:00.540
It is not aimed at all the people in your city, or all the people in your country, or all the people on this planet.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.920
Run --

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:06.800
if we want to send a virus to the middle of the sun,
if we want to visit the center of the sun,

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:14.220
run from this idea that we are working
for all the people on this planet.
We don't do that.

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:23.680
Get rid of this idea that we're trying to help
all the fish and all the birds and all the animals
that walk on land.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.840
We don't do that.  That's

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.620
not the point.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.560
We cover the entire Universe.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:39.300
We decide today that I would like to help
every living being in the Universe.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.540
Every little virus.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.360
Bacterium.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.300
Every whale.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.640
Every person in the Universe.  If

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:58.980
you're going out at night in Sedona or beyond,
Rim Rock is the place to be.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:03.340
And look at the stars and just try to imagine.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:20.640
So, first of all, you cannot practice the bodhisattva way of life
unless you develop your mind to this, to this goal.

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:28.709
And if you really experience this,
which takes some practice,

00:07:28.709 --> 00:07:30.850
if you really send your mind --

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:41.480
if you are really able to get bodhichitta,
then what you still have to do in this world is nothing.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:44.780
Nothing more.  It's not important.

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:51.380
To help all the people in this world, it's a small thing.
It's very simple.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:59.640
phen yon tang che pa (PHAN YON DANG BCAS PA) means
I want to tell you about the benefits of this kind of thinking.
This is the first step.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:02.657
chang chup tu sem kye pe tshyul (BYANG CHUB TU SEMS BSKYED PA'I TSUL)
Second step.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:06.560
How will you get to this breakthrough?
Mental breakthrough?

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:11.180
How to perceive the entire Universe
and all the beings in it?

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:15.800
And then develop love for them.  Is
this even possible?  Is

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.760
this even possible?
This is already the second step.

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:23.560
Step three.


00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:27.080
We are going to learn how to act like a bodhisattva.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:34.900
Once you have this hope of becoming a bodhisattva, then
what should I do?

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:41.300
How should I spend the hours of my day
if I want to act like a bodhisattva?

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.260
What should I do?

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:48.600
What will my schedule be?

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.200
Fine.  Here is the first of them.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:58.860
tang po ni (DANG PO NI,)
te tar kye wu chung dring ki kap su ngge jyung ki sam pe kun ne lang (DE LTAR SKYES BU CHUNG 'BRING GI SKABS SU NGES 'BYUNG GI BSAM PAS KUN NAS BSLANGS)

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:08.340
So now that we have gone through the steps of the path for people of lower ability and average ability,

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:13.960
at least, you must have this feeling that

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.100
in reality this life is pain, in reality this life is a disaster.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.580
The virus just makes it obvious.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.020
But it has always been like this.  There

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.940
has always been a virus called Death.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:29.280
This is a new virus.  It is much smaller.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:33.340
But now we all at least think about it.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:37.220
хлак пе лап па сум ла бе пе (LHAG PA'I BSLAB PA GSUM LA 'BAD PAS)

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:42.479
Then we would have to
work on three extraordinary workouts.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:44.580
Treat other people well.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.720
Spend time in meditation.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:52.980
And then try to see
that things do not happen from their own side.

