don tang,)
shen ton yang nyi tshe wa le mi jyung gzhan don yang nyi tse ba la mi 'byung) nyi tshe wa

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:08.320
(nyi tse ba) is a very discouraging word here.

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.600
This is a very sad word.  It

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:16.340
says here that you can work on the paths that I have taught you so far,

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:19.480
you can continue to work
on all the meditations that I have already taught you,

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:25.120
but the amount of good
that you will do for yourself and others

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:29.040
is only a small part of what you need to do.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:34.900
ньи цхе ва (NYI TSE BA) means only a small amount of what
you have to do.

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:43.520
And by the way, the most common use of this word is the word meaning hell on earth.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.900
And this is very strange.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:49.580
That is, there is a big hell that people can end up in.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:56.840
But I always think about the person who was in a car accident and the car exploded and they were engulfed in flames.

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:02.945
In the scriptures it is called
NYI TSI BA'I DMYAL BA.

00:12:02.945 --> 00:12:08.220
A little piece of hell in this airplane.  In this plane of reality.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:13.080
And so this word NYI TSI BA means just a tiny piece.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:17.780
And here he says: do you want to help yourself
and do you want to help other people?

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.420
Everything I have taught you so far for 10 years is
NYI TSI BA.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:30.160
This is just a small part of what you could do, and now we are ready to get down to the serious stuff.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:35.880
Well Geshe-la, why did we spend 10 years to make NYI TSI BA, this little thing?

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:39.460
Why don't we just move on to higher things?

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:44.660
Because this little thing is a ladder
that will help you reach higher things.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:50.080
You cannot achieve higher things
unless you do the other two parts.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:55.093
Unless you practice all the steps of lam-rim
in the correct order,

00:12:55.093 --> 00:12:58.460
you will never get to the bodhisattva part.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:02.560
So you can't just say you don't want it.

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:10.260
Part of the bodhisattva way of life is mastery of the lower path, which is what helped you get here.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:14.760
And you never reject them.
You just grow out of them.

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:21.140
 


00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:27.320
The idea of ​​Buddhism is

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:30.320
that once you are ready,

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.460
and once you are prepared,

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:37.300
you should immediately go straight into the
bodhisattva way of life,

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:42.080
because if you don't --
you will still have to do it again,

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.749
and sooner or later you will have to come here.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:49.700
Maybe it will take a lifetime.
Maybe it will happen later in this life.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:57.780
Every now and then people come to me and say, I'm going to take a break from this Dharma.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:01.960
I feel like I need to take a break.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:05.740
