00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:10.600
I'm working on a big project
or I have family things to do,

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:15.600
and I need to take a break.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:19.400
When I was in India, I told one of my teachers once, I remember

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:25.350
45 years ago.

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:31.960
And I said, "I need to take a break," and they looked  at me and said, "Yeah, okay, but you'll come back."

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:36.120
You'll come back because there's nowhere else to go.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:44.300
You'll come back. You'll come back to it because you need to come back to it. Life will bring you here again.

00:14:45.029 --> 00:14:47.929
Because that's life. You need lamrim.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:52.901
Life will always bring you back to lamrim.
Until you die.

00:14:52.901 --> 00:14:55.680
And it will still bring you back to it later. @SLAR

