00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:50.100
And I’ll be strong enough to take care of you.
You don’t have to worry.

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:59.080
I’ll have enough strength to help you
and I will, I promise.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:16.460
And then her image kind of dissolves in your mind, and suddenly your father’s image appears.

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:18.500
And you look at your father.

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:31.260
And he has the same look.
It’s a kind of expectation. But also fear.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:37.400
So he looks at you like,
“Can you help me?”

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:42.500
Life is getting hard, life is hard right now.

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:47.360
Then you say, “Dad, don’t worry. I’m doing it!

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:49.820
I’m studying lam-rim.

00:22:50.200 --> 00:22:54.120
I’m studying a lot about emptiness.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:23:01.280
And actually, I know that I’ll have the tools
to help you soon.

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:04.680
So don’t worry. I’m doing it.
I’ll take care of it.”

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:09.540
And please don’t—
you don’t have to be afraid. You don’t have to worry.

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:13.100
I know what to do, and I’m doing it.

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:17.120
Everything will be okay, so don’t worry!

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:29.280
And then maybe someone  someone else close to you in your life,
your wife or your husband or your children,
one of your children,

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:32.100
their image appears before your mind.

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.140
Just their faces.

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:44.940
And they also look at you like, “Can you help me? Things are bad, really bad!”

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:50.940
Things are mortally dangerous, there is no other hope. Can you help me
?

00:23:54.220 --> 00:24:02.140
And you say:
I have everything under control, I will take care of it.
I can.

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:07.920
I will be strong enough to take care of you.

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:10.026
You really have nothing to worry about.

00:24:10.026 --> 00:24:11.623
I know what is going on.

00:24:11.623 --> 00:24:13.220
I know your situation.

00:24:13.880 --> 00:24:17.015
I know what this life is like.

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:24.500
I have it all figured out
and I will take care of you completely.

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:28.640
You have nothing to worry about.
You really have nothing to worry about.

00:24:28.660 --> 00:24:31.320
I will take care of it.

00:24:37.420 --> 00:24:43.320
And then that face disappears, and then you can start going through the faces of people you know.

00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:48.000
Close people, close relatives.

00:24:49.260 --> 00:24:51.260
Uncles, aunts.

00:24:51.680 --> 00:24:53.680
Brothers, sisters.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:57.280
Nephews, nieces.

00:24:59.300 --> 00:25:07.420
One by one they pop up in front of you
and you reassure them.

00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:12.920
And you  say, “It’s true, I’ll take care of it.
You won’t have to worry about anything.”

00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:22.000
And so we go through all the people you know.

00:25:22.780 --> 00:25:25.480
All the people you’ve ever met in your life.

00:25:26.480 --> 00:25:33.840
Then you start working with all the people you haven’t met yet, and all the people that exist in this world.

00:25:34.500 --> 00:25:36.500
Start with your own environment.

00:25:37.800 --> 00:25:45.820
Go to a city, the whole city, and you know you can’t reach everyone.

00:25:46.440 --> 00:25:49.400
But take a person here and take a person there.

00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:56.580
Take within the continent you live on.

00:25:57.640 --> 00:25:59.640
Reach everyone.

00:26:00.900 --> 00:26:02.900
And then move on.

00:26:03.860 --> 00:26:05.860
To other continents.

00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:13.480
And so we reach all the people in this world.

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:18.400
Just sitting here.

00:26:19.160 --> 00:26:23.820
And then you can start further
with the animals in this world, the fish.

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:34.380
I’m not talking about types of animals.
I’m talking about helping each individual animal.

00:26:36.500 --> 00:26:39.890
Each one is looking at you. Each one is waiting.

00:26:39.890 --> 00:26:44.260
Each one is afraid.
Each one is getting your personal guarantee.

00:26:44.620 --> 00:26:46.620
“I’m handling this. I’ll take care of this.”

00:26:48.770 --> 00:26:53.679
Just imagine going through each creature, the tiny creatures  at the bottom of the sea.

00:26:56.150 --> 00:26:58.150
Tiny creatures in your blood.

00:26:59.780 --> 00:27:01.780
Get to know each of them.

00:27:03.100 --> 00:27:05.260
Talk to them.

00:27:05.720 --> 00:27:13.720
And when you're done with all the life in this world,
we'll go to the next world.

00:27:13.720 --> 00:27:16.980
I don't know where the next world is.
I don't know, maybe it's Alpha Centauri?

00:27:17.660 --> 00:27:21.640
Maybe it's as far away as many light years.

00:27:24.040 --> 00:27:30.960
Go there and start doing the same meditation
for all the people on that world.

00:27:34.060 --> 00:27:41.660
And in this way, we encompass every world
in the entire universe.

00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:51.740
And the karma of meeting one by one
with each of the seven billion human beings,

00:27:52.840 --> 00:27:57.600
and with trillions of other beings on one planet,

00:27:58.060 --> 00:28:04.640
and then encompassing as many planets as there are. Countless planets.

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:06.640
Embracing every being out there,

00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:11.680
that's bodhichitta.

00:28:12.020 --> 00:28:15.820
That's the direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:28:15.840 --> 00:28:24.340
So please, for this class,
if you can just feel it.

00:28:26.140 --> 00:28:31.260
You shouldn't worry about yourself.
You shouldn't worry about your family.

00:28:31.880 --> 00:28:35.080
You really shouldn't worry about your country.

00:28:35.780 --> 00:28:40.740
And you shouldn't worry about the world being engulfed by a virus. It's all such small things!

00:28:41.720 --> 00:28:47.680
By the way, we'll take care of it.  about them.
We are working on a big project.

00:28:49.460 --> 00:28:54.820
We are making a commitment to help the entire universe.

00:28:55.920 --> 00:28:58.380
Countless billions of beings.

00:28:59.400 --> 00:29:03.560
Countless billions of animals and other beings.

00:29:05.140 --> 00:29:10.680
And we have this opportunity. You have this opportunity. I pray that you achieve this in this life.

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:14.760
I pray that you discover this in this life.

00:29:14.760 --> 00:29:28.840
Your mind is already capable of touching every single sentient being and promising them that you will take care of them.

00:29:32.500 --> 00:29:36.700
So the purpose of this lam-rim,
the purpose of this retreat,

00:29:37.420 --> 00:29:40.160
is something like a journey to the middle of the sun.

00:29:40.600 --> 00:29:43.000
Think of every single sentient being.

00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:46.860
Countless sentient beings in the universe without boundaries.

00:29:48.320 --> 00:29:49.960
Meet them one by one.

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:51.420
Make the promise one by one.

00:29:52.220 --> 00:29:58.360
This is what happens
during the first direct experience of bodhichitta.

00:29:58.360 --> 00:29:59.980
It actually happens.

00:30:00.060 --> 00:30:01.843
This is what it is like.

00:30:01.843 --> 00:30:05.340
If you keep imagining it,
it will help it happen.

00:30:06.000 --> 00:30:07.020
Really!

00:30:07.020 --> 00:30:10.759
So it is up to you if you want it to come.

00:30:11.340 --> 00:30:14.660
If you really want to be a real bodhisattva,

00:30:15.680 --> 00:30:22.220
then practice.
Practice this visualization once or twice.  per day.

00:30:22.980 --> 00:30:28.140
Just whenever you have a few minutes. Just imagine.
In your imagination, okay?

00:30:29.159 --> 00:30:32.989
And that will help it happen.
And you will attain bodhichitta.

00:30:35.060 --> 00:30:43.120
Then something like a virus, for that kind of bodhisattva, a virus is not a very important thing.

00:30:43.120 --> 00:30:45.816
It's a very, very small thing.
It's a very, very small thing.

00:30:45.820 --> 00:30:47.240
Making money. Making a

00:30:47.820 --> 00:30:49.360
living. Feeding

00:30:49.600 --> 00:30:50.940
your family.

00:30:51.600 --> 00:30:53.600
Finding an apartment.

00:30:54.060 --> 00:30:58.660
These are incredibly tiny things. There's nothing
there.

00:31:00.240 --> 00:31:03.680
Your mind is like--
your heart is like the middle of the sun.

00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:15.120
And a few more, I don't know, a few cookies or a few Cokes in the middle of the sun, it doesn't matter.

00:31:16.380 --> 00:31:18.040
It's not that important.

00:31:18.560 --> 00:31:20.220
Go for the big thing!

00:31:21.440 --> 00:31:23.662
Everything else becomes small.

00:31:23.662 --> 00:31:26.920
And everything else becomes convenient. Easy.

00:31:27.820 --> 00:31:29.820
That's bodhichitta.

